		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Honey colored ooze made from an ochre jelly that consumes a hive's royal jelly, developing unusual powers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tentacle +3 (1d6) and control vermin, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> -3, <strong>Ch</strong> -4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Control Vermin</strong>. Control mindless winged, bee-like swarms or vermin within far.</p><p></p><p><strong>Split</strong>. If cut or chopped, split into two smaller oozes (divide remaining HP between both). Can split up to four times.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
